      "comment": "BONITO (3) has a strong record this track and trip with five wins and six placings from 14 starts. In the money last time at this track (24.04) in a Grade 4, finishing a 2.25 lengths third. Has the ability and looks a key chance here. BUSHMAN'S ARCHIE (1) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (24.14) at this track in a Grade 3/4 over 407m. Has a solid record from this box including four wins and a minor placing. Winning chance. CANGRANDE (8) is a quick beginner who bombed the start last time and missed the frame, finishing seventh (24.37) in a Grade 4 at this track. Prior to that was quickly into stride and scored (24.37) at this track. Won at his only start from this draw. Leading chance. WAKA WAKA (2) must be respected despite an unplaced effort here most recently.",
